evere downpour, which abruptly halted all of our further plans. Took provisional shelter at the Ahiritola Ghat untill the rain subsided. 🙁","url":"https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111894883359485991"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111891258289614848","3_2111891274999721984","3_2111891293077114880","3_2111891308554211328"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-18T18:45:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111891319358701928"],"id":"2111891319358701928","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":325,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#92 Visited Hindustan Park. Decent https://t.co/gucYqupXc8","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111891319358701928"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111889722134167552","3_2111889756749754369","3_2111889775733153792","3_2111889791432409088"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-18T18:39:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111889804854215094"],"id":"2111889804854215094","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":388,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#91 Visited Hindustan Club. They are famous for their lighting. https://t.co/Mb2uqynOkD","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111889804854215094"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111874985258307584","3_2111874997354663936","3_2111875010633895936","3_2111875024269570049"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-18T17:40:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111875032985321885"],"id":"2111875032985321885","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":902,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"#82 Visited Ballygunge Cultural. Good pandal, bad pratima. https://t.co/X52kdnH5Ck","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111875032985321885"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111826404602236928","3_2111826404648316928","3_2111826404702892032"]},"author_id":"1495438105","created_at":"2026-10-18T14:27:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111826416765747682"],"id":"2111826416765747682","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":5613,"like_count":37,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":9},"text":"WEST BENGAL FIRE SERVICES ISSUES ULTIMATUM TO TOP KOLKATA PUJA CLUBS OVER SAFETY VIOLATIONS\nKOLKATA — \n\nIn a major development following inspections by a high-power state committee, the West Bengal Fire &amp; Emergency Services (South Kolkata Division) has issued strict compliance https://t.co/J5WCgKOYtk","url":"https://x.com/KamalikaSengupt/status/2111826416765747682"},{"author_id":"1674681718895411201","created_at":"2026-10-18T06:32:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111707069191729395"],"id":"2111707069191729395","in_reply_to_user_id":"3236685834","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":85,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111671635707314677","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@goonereol I haven’t been there in recent times but I was turned away from Kashi Bose lane the year before on tritiya. Majority pandals have always opened from choturthi panchami only. Last year on choturthi there was still work going on in sikdar Bagan and nabinpally didn’t allow us in.","url":"https://x.com/reindeerdodo89/status/2111707069191729395"},{"author_id":"3007649773","created_at":"2026-10-18T04:20:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111673837247213635"],"id":"2111673837247213635","in_reply_to_user_id":"1594228184290992129","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":156,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111665394218070484","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@bromcorleone Agreed I saw women too pushing unnecessarily on shasti in Hindustan park even when there wasn't a huge crowd","url":"https://x.com/biharigurl/status/2111673837247213635"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:59:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111653404691071073"],"id":"2111653404691071073","in_reply_to_user_id":"60282284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":79,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111621420472246638","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@mrs__hazel On Saptami 2024, a heavy downpour happened for almost 40/45 mins, starting at around 7pm ... I , at that very moment, was at the Ahiritola Pujo which probably was one of the best that year... The police took barely 2 to 3 mins to clear our the entire queue ...","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111653404691071073"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:43:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111649366587154726"],"id":"2111649366587154726","in_reply_to_user_id":"2044335618512076800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111531598130889212","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@AarKiBolboBolo2 It rained last year too... There was a downpour on Ashtami during 2024 too... In 2024 , I was at the Ahiritola pujo when the downpour started and it took the administration just a couple of minutes to clear our the entire queue","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111649366587154726"},{"author_id":"2277541244","created_at":"2026-10-17T21:04:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111564063922913482"],"id":"2111564063922913482","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Dear @SuvenduWB Ji, \n\nI have visited today Hatibagan Nabinpally pandel on 17th oct 2026, I had VIP pass but they are entering all public in VIP rows. If there any accident happened who will be responsible. WB govt or Committe member. \n\n@ANI @RbharatNews @tak_ajj @ABPNews @ZeeNews","url":"https://x.com/Umasankar2019/status/2111564063922913482"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111535533130452992"]},"author_id":"85990997","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:11:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111535552352907689"],"id":"2111535552352907689","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1644,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Last night in #Kolkata ! 💔\n\nA very unfortunate incident has happened in the north Kolkata! Maa, protect us! 🙏🏼\n\nEnded the pandal hopping today with Hindustan Park Sarbojanin. \n\nChildren at Match box making is the theme.\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #DurgaPuja #KolkataDurgaPuja https://t.co/JzaqGFADRX","url":"https://x.com/PantryCar/status/2111535552352907689"},{"author_id":"803197771389861888","created_at":"2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111518921622999095"],"id":"2111518921622999095","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":4718,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"text":"I’m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. ❤️\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab","url":"https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111453243108970497","3_2111453425091432449","3_2111453578665848833"]},"author_id":"125928961","created_at":"2026-10-17T13:46:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111453764645503396"],"id":"2111453764645503396","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3518,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Sea of crowd #DurgaPuja2026 \n\nBallygunge Cultural Association https://t.co/zgEAxa1umi","url":"https://x.com/MoneyMystery/status/2111453764645503396"},{"author_id":"70626051","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:43:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111437874298232933"],"id":"2111437874298232933","in_reply_to_u